**git-worktree isolation**, an **engine toggle** (Claudeâ†”Gemini), **cached/validated session + project summaries**, a **grass-idea board**, **cost/tokens/time rollups**, **deliverable launch-by-type**, and **Ghost World Labs branding**.\n\n**One grounding caveat:** these claims come from the project's own `CLAUDE.md` and memory index, not from re-reading the source â€” they describe the documented/intended state. If you want, I can verify any specific claim (e.g., that the v4 surface is actually wired up) against the code."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4253,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24695,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24695},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f66d76ab-5cc2-41a6-b827-31f76606b6cc","uuid":"3eeac413-fd6b-4a97-8ff4-622797a31c0b","request_id":"req_011Cc1Hhk7XAuzcuCLzNwv4a"}
